    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Tracer vaccine coverages - last 5 years\" for Trainingland, coverage (%) from 2013 to 2016 for BCG, DPT-HepB-Hib 1, DPT-HepB-Hib 3, IPV, MR 1, MR 2 and yellow fever. Every series rises. The top line (BCG and DPT-HepB-Hib 1, overlapping) goes 68.9, 73.1, 80.2, 81.4; MR 2 is lowest, from 46.2 in 2013 through 49.7 and 54.4 to about 68 in 2016. Other labelled values (54.9, 64.3, 66.7, 72.5, 64.4) sit on overlapping middle lines.",
